Model base
Stim decision models are built on the Qwen family of foundation models (Qwen3.5),
developed by Alibaba Group and its affiliates. Qwen model weights and code are
distributed under their own licence terms; see the upstream release for details.

Design reference
Stim's design references the Kev project (jaredpalmer/kev), an Apache-2.0 open
implementation of a Jev-style decision model family. No Kev source code, corpus, or
runtime dependency is included in this repository.
